# ============================================================
# QuixelCEBridge repo — keep: plugin source (+ bundled bin CLIs),
# _test scripts & small fixtures. Everything else is reference
# material, build output or generated test output.
# ============================================================

# --- Python runtime artifacts (regenerated on import)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log

# --- plugin runtime dumps (contain local absolute paths)
last_payload.json

# --- generated e2e test output (fake project: CGF/DDS/TIF/MTL...)
_test/gameproject/
_test/*.log

# --- local test scratch (payloads captured from live runs)
_test/run_*.bak

# --- third-party reference material, not our code
MSPlugin/
Python Bridge Manual/
Cryengine/
CryEngineTextureProcessor_source/
CryEngineTextureProcessor_build/

# --- editor / OS noise
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
